the European Central Bank,

00:35:19.350 --> 00:35:20.440
complete.

00:35:20.440 --> 00:35:23.910
So the Envoy has been configured
with the rules it needs.

00:35:23.910 --> 00:35:26.520
And then if we go
into the front end,

00:35:26.520 --> 00:35:31.610
and we just try to
do a refresh here--

00:35:31.610 --> 00:35:33.710
it's a bit slow.

00:35:33.710 --> 00:35:36.530
We may or may not have some
